  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Client-side tools",
      "items": [
        "Layout Fix maps characters by physical key position and preserves characters missing from the source layout. (README.md:28–30; layouts.js:844–869)",
        "Romaji conversion uses the local mora table and implements Hepburn typing rules in the browser. (README.md:54–65; kana.js:42–105; kana-data.js:1–6)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Shared browser behavior",
      "items": [
        "Both pages load the shared theme controller and CSS palette. (README.md:71–83; index.html:7, 105–107; romaji.html:7, 90–92)",
        "Light or dark selection is stored under localStorage key 'theme'; system mode removes the key. (theme.js:1–24)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "External assets and build",
      "items": [
        "The shared stylesheet imports Space Grotesk and JetBrains Mono from Google Fonts. (style.css:1)",
        "GitHub Actions runs a Jekyll container build on main pushes and pull requests; this workflow does not deploy Pages. (.github/workflows/jekyll-docker.yml:3–19)"
      ]
    }
  ]
